{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDExLS0yMDE1L0xhZ2dpZXMlMjAlMjgyMDE0JTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"Laggies","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/kL2ccASO8O6v92gGTaaY5gOCAI4.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qQOHMXOBE3MFHW1NYi4XkvqEZWO.jpg","description":"Overeducated and underemployed, 28 year old Megan is in the throes of a quarterlife crisis. Squarely into adulthood with no career prospects, no particular motivation to think about her future and no one to relate to, Megan is comfortable lagging a few steps behind - while her friends check off milestones and celebrate their new grown-up status. When her high-school sweetheart proposes, Megan panics and- given an unexpected opportunity to escape for a week - hides out in the home of her new friend, 16-year old Annika and Annika's world-weary single dad Craig.","releaseInfo":"2014","genres":["Comedy","Drama","Romance","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"6.1","runtime":"100 min","cast":["Keira Knightley","Chloë Grace Moretz","Sam Rockwell","Kaitlyn Dever","Ellie Kemper","Mark Webber","Jeff Garlin","Daniel Zovatto"],"director":["Lynn Shelton"],"released":"2014-09-25T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"Acting your age is so overrated.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Keira Knightley","character":"Megan Burch","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/bRC1B2VwV0wK3ElciFAK6QZf2wD.jpg"},{"name":"Chloë Grace Moretz","character":"Annika Hunter","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/yq4rYmaTRC5degaOYmJQFpaiho1.jpg"},{"name":"Sam Rockwell","character":"Craig Hunter","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/afYhNpLwpa65Yy0Q0g00FNFhzx5.jpg"},{"name":"Kaitlyn Dever","character":"Misty","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/np5rBCFRdeS1sXePL8uY09ktoC4.jpg"},{"name":"Ellie Kemper","character":"Allison","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/2rWtHAdr1lXQBzxOcVZ3CyYPDEI.jpg"},{"name":"Mark Webber","character":"Anthony","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/y30VskmtlxNLz1HIM